editorialMd:
The working idea

Replace each negative reading with 0; leave every other reading unchanged.

Return the first value in the derived sequence that is at least k, or -1 if there is none. Return the value, not its index.

Why this works

Each derived value follows the unit's stated order and includes exactly the items allowed by its definition. The receipt then folds or filters those values without changing their meaning. Check the empty, singleton, repeated and maximum-size inputs before trusting the final total.

Target time O(n); space O(n).

javascript
function stampGatesFirstQualifyingSlip(readings, k) {
  const a=readings; let out=[];
  for(const x of a)out.push(x<0?0:x);
  return out.find(x=>x>=k)??-1;
}


